  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Examining Image Assets**\n\nI\'m now diving into the `src/assets/images` directory and finding files like `boxer_champion_training_1790843406316.jpg` and `hero_bodybuilders_1790482652879.jpg`. I also see that there are files in `public/images`, namely `hero-bodybuilders.jpg` and `logo.png`. I\'m going to look at the Next.js API proxy route located at `src/app/api/proxy`.\n\n\n**Designing API Client**\n\nI\'m now focusing on designing the API client in `src/lib/authApi.ts`, defining `API_BASE` as `\"https://apitest.thewarriors.team/api\"`. I\'ll also build `src/app/api/proxy/[...path]/route.ts` to forward `POST` requests and `FormData` correctly, including headers like `Authorization` for logout. I\'m testing Next.js App Router\'s requirements for forwarding `FormData`.\n\n\n**Testing API Routes**\n\nI\'m now determining if the client can directly call the API at `https://apitest.thewarriors.team/api` or if it must go through `/api/proxy/*`. I\'m verifying the reliability of the `/api/proxy/*` approach within the AI Studio container and preview iframe, especially considering potential cross-origin issues with third-party cookies.\n\n\n**Structuring Auth Library**\n\nI\'m now implementing the folder structure as requested. I\'ll create `src/lib/types/auth.ts` for TypeScript types like `User`, `LoginResponse`, and others. Then, `src/lib/authApi.ts` will contain typed API client functions such as `login`, `register`, `verifyOtp`, and more. I\'m focusing on building these pieces cleanly in separate files.\n\n\n**Defining Auth Context**\n\nI\'m now building the `AuthContext` to manage user authentication state, including `user`, `token`, and `isAuthenticated`. I\'m including `isLoading`, `latestOtp`, and functions like `login`, `logout`, and `saveAuth`. The `setLatestOtp` function will allow us to store the OTP data, and make available to the rest of the application.\n\n\n**Constructing Auth Components**\n\nI\'m now building out key components, starting with `AuthLayout` for responsive layout, incorporating hero sections and auth card containers, complete with a back-to-home link. I am moving on to `AuthInputField`, a high-performance input, including icons and error states, with password visibility toggles and focus styling. Following this, I am building the OTP notification banner, as well as the login form and login card components.\n\n\n**Building Registration Components**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the registration form, specifically `src/components/auth/register/RegisterForm.tsx`. I\'m integrating fields for first and last name, email, password (with confirmation and visibility toggle), a terms checkbox, a register button, and a link to the login page. I\'m also building a wrapper card, `RegisterCard.tsx`, with a headline and subtitle.\n\n**Constructing OTP Verification**\n\nI\'m now constructing the OTP verification flow in `OtpVerificationCard.tsx`, including displaying the email being verified, showing the OTP from the API response (e.g., \"[XXXXXX]\"), an autofill button, resend countdown, and a verify button that redirects to the login page upon success. I\'m also building the forgot password flow.\n\n\n**Implementing Forgot Password**\n\nI\'m now building the forgot password flow. This involves two stages: email entry to capture the OTP from the API response at `/api/forgot-password`, and OTP entry for verification against `/api/forgot-verify-otp` to get a reset token. Afterwards, I\'ll redirect to `ResetPasswordCard.tsx` to call `/api/reset-password` and update the password. I\'m updating App Routes. I\'ll connect the hero navigation and other areas as required.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_141929"
      name: "create_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Content\":\"export interface User {\\n  id: number;\\n  first_name: string | null;\\n  last_name: string | null;\\n  email: string;\\n  role?: string;\\n  terms?: boolean;\\n  email_verified_status?: boolean;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface LoginResponse {\\n  status: boolean;\\n  message: string;\\n  token_type?: string;\\n  token?: string;\\n  data?: User;\\n  errors?: Record<string, string[]>;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface RegisterResponse {\\n  status: number | boolean;\\n  message: string;\\n  data?: {\\n    otp: string;\\n    email: string;\\n  };\\n  errors?: Record<string, string[]>;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface VerifyOtpResponse {\\n  status: boolean | number;\\n  message: string;\\n  token_type?: string;\\n  token?: string;\\n  data?: User;\\n  errors?: Record<string, string[]>;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ResendOtpResponse {\\n  status: number | boolean;\\n  message: string;\\n  data?: {\\n    otp: string;\\n  };\\n  errors?: Record<string, string[]>;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ForgotPasswordResponse {\\n  status: number | boolean;\\n  message: string;\\n  data?: {\\n    otp: string;\\n  };\\n  errors?: Record<string, string[]>;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ForgotVerifyOtpResponse {\\n  status: number | boolean;\\n  message: string;\\n  data?: {\\n    token: string;\\n  };\\n  errors?: Record<string, string[]>;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ResetPasswordResponse {\\n  status: number | boolean;\\n  message: string;\\n  data?: any;\\n  errors?: Record<string, string[]>;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface LogoutResponse {\\n  status: number | boolean;\\n  message: string;\\n  data?: any;\\n}\\n\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/lib/types/auth.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating auth types\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create auth types file\"}"
