e.g., \"WELCOME BACK, <span className=\'text-[#71AC16]\'>WARRIOR</span>\") to welcome the user.\n\n\n**Adjusting Form Placement**\n\nI\'m now focusing on refining the `/login`, `/register`, `/verify-otp`, and `/forgot-password` pages by removing the `AuthSideHero` and the `card` styling, and centering the forms cleanly within a responsive container. The forms will now have the white background and will have no header and no footer. I am styling the form inputs with a light theme, ensuring the OTP banner is clearly styled. The components I\'m reviewing are `AuthLayout.tsx`, `AuthBrandLogo.tsx`.\n\n\n"
