  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing User Specification**\n\nI\'m now carefully dissecting the user\'s requirements. Specifically, I\'m focusing on the login state and its impact on the lending page registration button, plus the logic for displaying the user\'s first initial after login. I\'m considering how this initial ties into the profile creation/click process and subsequent logout.\n\n\n**Refining UI Element States**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on UI element states. Specifically, I\'m defining the button visibility based on the authentication status; when a user logs in, the \"REGISTER\" and \"LOGIN\" buttons vanish. Next, I\'ve got to ensure the initial letter avatar displays correctly and reflects the user\'s first name or email fallback. I\'m also considering aesthetic styles for this circular avatar, thinking about the visual appeal.\n\n\n**Designing Profile Interactions**\n\nI\'m now deep-diving into the profile click interactions. I\'ve designed the profile circle: it features a bold, centered capital letter (the user\'s first initial), rendered in Satoshi font. It will have a subtle ring and hover scale animation. I\'m focusing on the dropdown menu design. When clicked, it opens directly below, with user info including the initial badge, name, email, and role. I\'ve also built a log out button inside, triggering a full logout, token removal, and state reset when clicked.\n\n\n**Implementing Unauthenticated State**\n\nI\'ve got the landing page header returning to the unauthenticated state, immediately displaying the \"LOGIN\" and \"REGISTER\" buttons! I\'ve also implemented a mousedown click-outside listener and escape key handler to ensure the dropdown menu closes smoothly. Its position is now `top-[120%] right-0 z-50` with a clean shadow. Plus, I\'ve enabled `pointer-events-auto` on the button and menu. I\'ve double-checked the letter calculation and will write a clean component or integrate it in `HeroTopNav.tsx`.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_712459"
      name: "create_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Content\":\"\\\"use client\\\";\\nimport React, { useState, useRef, useEffect } from \\\"react\\\";\\nimport Link from \\\"next/link\\\";\\nimport { useAuth } from \\\"@/context/AuthContext\\\";\\nimport { LogOut, User as UserIcon, Check, ChevronDown } from \\\"lucide-react\\\";\\n\\nexport const HeroTopNav: React.FC = () => {\\n  const [searchQuery, setSearchQuery] = useState(\\\"\\\");\\n  const [showUserMenu, setShowUserMenu] = useState(false);\\n  const menuRef = useRef<HTMLDivElement>(null);\\n  const { user, isAuthenticated, logout } = useAuth();\\n\\n  const handleScrollTo = (id: string) => {\\n    const el = document.getElementById(id);\\n    if (el) {\\n      el.scrollIntoView({ behavior: \\\"smooth\\\", block: \\\"start\\\" });\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  // Close menu on click outside or Escape\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    const handleClickOutside = (event: MouseEvent) => {\\n      if (menuRef.current && !menuRef.current.contains(event.target as Node)) {\\n        setShowUserMenu(false);\\n      }\\n    };\\n\\n    const handleKeyDown = (event: KeyboardEvent) => {\\n      if (event.key === \\\"Escape\\\") {\\n        setShowUserMenu(false);\\n      }\\n    };\\n\\n    if (showUserMenu) {\\n      document.addEventListener(\\\"mousedown\\\", handleClickOutside);\\n      document.addEventListener(\\\"keydown\\\", handleKeyDown);\\n    }\\n\\n    return () => {\\n      document.removeEventListener(\\\"mousedown\\\", handleClickOutside);\\n      document.removeEventListener(\\\"keydown\\\", handleKeyDown);\\n    };\\n  }, [showUserMenu]);\\n\\n  // First name\'s first letter for profile circle\\n  const firstLetter = (\\n    user?.first_name?.trim()?.charAt(0) ||\\n    user?.email?.trim()?.charAt(0) ||\\n    \\\"U\\\"\\n  ).toUpperCase();\\n\\n  const fullName =\\n    [user?.first_name, user?.last_name].filter(Boolean).join(\\\" \\\") ||\\n    user?.email?.split(\\\"@\\\")[0] ||\\n    \\\"Athlete\\\";\\n\\n  const handleLogout = async () => {\\n    setShowUserMenu(false);\\n    await logout();\\n  };\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"absolute top-[2.4%] left-[2.8%] right-[2.8%] z-30 flex items-center justify-between pointer-events-auto select-none\\\">\\n      {/* Brand Logo Button: Vibrant Lime Green circle with logo.png rotated -45 deg */}\\n      <Link\\n        href=\\\"/\\\"\\n        onClick={(e) => {\\n          if (window.location.pathname === \\\"/\\\") {\\n            e.preventDefault();\\n            window.scrollTo({ top: 0, behavior: \\\"smooth\\\" });\\n          }\\n        }}\\n        className=\\\"flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#71AC16] shadow-md hover:scale-105 active:scale-95 transition-transform\\\"\\n        style={{\\n          width: \\\"5.8cqw\\\",\\n          height: \\\"5.8cqw\\\",\\n        }}\\n        aria-label=\\\"Home\\\"\\n      >\\n        <img\\n          src=\\\"/images/logo.png\\\"\\n          alt=\\\"Logo\\\"\\n          width={48}\\n          height={48}\\n          className=\\\"w-[58%] h-[58%] object-contain\\\"\\n          style={{\\n            transform: \\\"rotate(-45deg)\\\",\\n          }}\\n        />\\n      </Link>\\n\\n      {/* Center Nav Pill: Black background with subtle crisp white border and clean typography */}\\n      <div\\n        className=\\\"flex items-center bg-black border border-white/90 rounded-full text-white shadow-sm\\\"\\n        style={{\\n          padding: \\\"0.55cqw 0.75cqw 0.55cqw 2.4cqw\\\",\\n          gap: \\\"1.8cqw\\\",\\n          transform: \\\"translate(-3cqw, 1.2cqw)\\\",\\n        }}\\n      >\\n        <a\\n          href=\\\"#home\\\"\\n          onClick={(e) => {\\n            e.preventDefault();\\n            window.scrollTo({ top: 0, behavior: \\\"smooth\\\" });\\n          }}\\n          className=\\\"text-white hover:text-[#71AC16] transition-colors font-medium whitespace-nowrap cursor-pointer\\\"\\n          style={{\\n            fontSize: \\\"1.25cqw\\\",\\n            letterSpaci